OL,3,APoundland gets more time to secure a
OL,4,Arescue deal as emergency talks continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA committee of MPs questioned Gordon
OL,7,FBrothers following accusations that the
OL,8,Finvestment firm hoped to profit from
OL,9,Fselling off Poundland's 600 shops and
OL,10,Fstock piecemeal.
